{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o127a","title":"城沙羡","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o127a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"城沙羡","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o127a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":239,"label":"夏五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y239","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o126","basis":"夏五月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o127a-q","wuzhu-q-o126","houfei-q-o050","shaodi-q-o002","mingdi-q-o068","mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o127a-q","source_order":[47,674,"O127a"],"order":8345}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o050","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6dc749ac781a81d5a82f","layer":"original","quote":"帝疾困，遂立为皇后。齐王即位，尊后为皇太后，称“永宁宫”。追封谥太后父满，为西都定侯，以立子建绍其爵。封太后母杜，为郃阳君。芝迁散骑常侍、长水校尉；﹝一﹞立，宣德将军〖2〗；皆封列侯。建兄德，出养甄氏。德及建，俱为镇护将军〖3〗，皆封列侯，并掌宿卫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗三年：景初三年（公元 239）。丁亥：旧历初一日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":496,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-271e1436daf6e49feb83","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o068","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129},{"id":"shaodi-q-o002","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-69d95c2d10b2c4a40b0c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，立为齐王。景初三年正月，丁亥朔，帝病甚，乃立为皇太子。是日，即皇帝位。大赦。尊皇后曰皇太后〖2〗。大将军曹爽、太尉司马宣王辅政。诏曰：“朕以眇身〖3〗，继承鸿业。茕茕在疚〖4〗，靡所控告〖5〗。大将军、太尉奉受末命〖6〗，夹辅朕躬；司徒、司空，冢宰元辅总率百僚〖7〗，以宁社稷；其与群卿大夫勉勖乃心〖8〗，称朕意焉。”诸所兴作宫室之役，皆以遗诏罢之；官奴婢六十以上，免为良人〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":196},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o127a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-446315cadffdc8e7a5fe","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，城沙羡。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o126","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab932a5023f68052057f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春三月〖1〗，﹝一﹞遣使者羊衜、郑胄、将军孙怡，之辽东，击魏守将张持、高虑等，虏得男女。﹝二﹞零陵言甘露降。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
